---
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-y border-cocoa/10 bg-cream py-24 lg:py-32">
  <div class="section-content mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-14 px-5 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-10">
    <div class="relative reveal">
      <div class="parallax-frame h-[520px] rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-soft">
        <img class="parallax-img" data-speed="-.12" src="/philosophy.webp" alt="Marta Włodarska - Piąty Żywioł" />
      </div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-5 left-8 rounded-full bg-cocoa p-2.5 text-cream shadow-soft">
        <div class="relative h-[73px] w-[73px]">
          <svg class="absolute inset-0 animate-rotateBadge" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
            <defs><path id="circleText" d="M 50, 50 m -36, 0 a 36,36 0 1,1 72,0 a 36,36 0 1,1 -72,0" /></defs>
            <text class="fill-cream text-[6px] uppercase tracking-[.25em]"><textPath href="#circleText">Piąty Żywioł · Beauty &amp; Massage · </textPath></text>
          </svg>
          <img src="/logo.webp" alt="Piąty Żywioł" class="absolute inset-[18px] h-[37px] w-[37px] rounded-full object-contain" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.34em] text-clay">Filozofia pracy</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-5xl font-medium leading-[.95] tracking-[-.035em] md:text-7xl">Naturalny efekt zamiast presji na perfekcję.</h2>
      <p class="mt-8 text-sm leading-8 text-cocoa/65 md:text-base">Tutaj zabieg nie jest tylko usługą. To krótki reset, po którym odzyskujesz spokój i równowagę.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 divide-y divide-cocoa/10 border-y border-cocoa/10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-5"><span class="font-medium">Rozluźnienie napięć</span><span class="text-clay">+</span></div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-5"><span class="font-medium">Naturalny glow skóry</span><span class="text-clay">+</span></div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-5"><span class="font-medium">Spokojna, kameralna atmosfera</span><span class="text-clay">+</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
